# Signal: Upsilon(4S) -> B0 anti-B0 (with mixing), one B forced to
#   B0 -> D*- tau+ nu_tau,  D*- -> anti-D0 pi-,  anti-D0 -> K+ pi-,  tau+ -> mu+ nu nu
# The other B decays generically via DECAY.DEC.
# Form factor: ISGW2 (v1; upgrade to BGL/CLN later).

Alias      B0sig        B0
Alias      anti-B0sig   anti-B0
ChargeConj B0sig        anti-B0sig

Alias      D*+sig       D*+
Alias      D*-sig       D*-
ChargeConj D*+sig       D*-sig

Alias      D0sig        D0
Alias      anti-D0sig   anti-D0
ChargeConj D0sig        anti-D0sig

Alias      tau+sig      tau+
Alias      tau-sig      tau-
ChargeConj tau+sig      tau-sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.000  B0sig anti-B0sig B0 anti-B0   VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay B0sig
1.000  D*-sig tau+sig nu_tau         ISGW2;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-B0sig

Decay D*-sig
1.000  anti-D0sig pi-                VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay D*+sig

Decay anti-D0sig
1.000  K+ pi-                        PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay D0sig

Decay tau+sig
1.000  mu+ nu_mu anti-nu_tau         TAULNUNU;
Enddecay
CDecay tau-sig

End
